{
	"addonId": "visionMate",
	"displayName": "VisionMate",
	"URL": "https://github.com/athee06/VisionMate/releases/download/v6.0.0/VisionMate-6.0.0.nvda-addon",
	"description": "Fast, fully offline image description and an accessible overlay for windows NVDA cannot read. Everything runs on your own computer. Images are never sent to the internet.\nNVDA+Alt+A: describe the current element\nNVDA+Alt+W: describe the current window\nNVDA+Alt+F: describe the whole screen\nNVDA+Alt+D: describe the clipboard image\nNVDA+Alt+E: find something on screen, like the Save button, and click it\nOn a photo message in a chat app, or an image file in File Explorer, NVDA+Alt+A describes the photo itself.\nPress twice for a detailed description in a window, where you can ask questions about the image.\nNVDA+Alt+O: the overlay, a list of a window's texts and icons; Enter clicks an item\nNVDA+Alt+G: automatic descriptions of images without a label, on or off\nNVDA+Alt+B: names for buttons without a name, on or off\nNVDA+Alt+N: give your own name to a button or overlay item\nNVDA+Alt+Shift+A: describe the newest picture in a chat\nNVDA+Alt+P: how far a description is; NVDA+Alt+X: stop it\nNVDA+Alt+U: pointer mode, the mouse from the keyboard; NVDA+Alt+Q: controller mode\nNVDA+Alt+Y: take the help offered where a window tells NVDA little",
	"sha256": "be0ccd153ca09944717ed02a41bc5f130e3059e9b5d2802525504f433efc26ac",
