	"changelog": "* New: pointer mode (NVDA+Alt+U) works the mouse from the keyboard and says what is under the pointer. Space holds the button for dragging, H hovers and reads what appears, T gives touch and pen gestures, G is a game mouse for games that turn the view with the mouse.\n* New: controller mode (NVDA+Alt+Q, or View and Menu held together): a game controller works the mouse pointer.\n* New: NVDA+Alt+E finds something on screen, like the Save button, says roughly where it is, and can click it or move the mouse there.\n* New: NVDA+Alt+Shift+A describes the newest picture in a chat, leaving out emoji and profile pictures.\n* New: NVDA+Alt+X stops a description or an answer; NVDA+Alt+P says how far it is.\n* New: actions in the overlay (A) and in find on screen (More): hover, drag and drop, press and hold, set a drawn knob or slider to a number, work it with the arrow keys, write on a scanned form, touch and pen.\n* Overlay: fields and errors marked in red (R), colour choices named by measured colour, picture puzzles of human checks numbered and described, the most useful item (U), tables (T, Control+Alt+arrows) and \"more below\" for areas that scroll.\n* Overlay: an icon or thumbnail beside a label is no longer a separate item, and NVDA's mouse tracking no longer talks over the overlay.\n* Detailed window: Read all text, Describe people, Describe colours, Where is..., and Save (Control+S). Questions in several parts are answered part by part; colours are measured from the pixels.\n* New: help offered where a window, dialog or control tells NVDA little (NVDA+Alt+Y).\n* New: memories (\"remember that ...\"), your own instructions, VisionMate's own voice, and a portable copy for a flash drive or another computer.\n* Faster: pressing again on a screen that barely changed starts speaking in under a second; background work gets out of the way sooner.\n* More reliable: the engine restarts by itself if it stops; a dropped download resumes; low disk space is reported first.\n* Settings are in groups, with Reset to defaults.",
	"licenseURL": "https://github.com/athee06/VisionMate/blob/main/LICENSE",
